sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant WA as Meta Cloud API
    participant CE as Conversation Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>WA: sends a text message
    WA->>CE: POST /webhooks/whatsapp (message id, from, restaurant phone id, payload)
    CE->>CE: verify x-hub-signature-256 against the RAW body (401 if invalid)
    CE->>CE: validate the envelope (Zod) · delivery statuses are counted and ignored
    CE->>DB: BEGIN · INSERT processed_webhook_events (event_id=message id, source='whatsapp')<br/>ON CONFLICT (event_id, source) DO NOTHING RETURNING id
    DB-->>CE: rowcount
    alt rowcount = 0 (already processed)
        CE->>DB: skip this message
        Note over CE: Covers even the first message of a brand-new conversation,<br/>where no session exists yet to hold a reference.
    else rowcount = 1 (genuinely new)
        CE->>DB: app.resolve_restaurant_by_phone_id(phone_id)
        DB-->>CE: restaurant_id (none: ROLLBACK, 500, Meta resends)
        CE->>DB: set_config('app.current_restaurant_id', restaurant_id, true)
        Note over CE,DB: Every query from here on is under row-level security.
        CE->>DB: INSERT inbound_messages (raw payload kept)
        CE->>DB: SELECT active session (state NOT IN order_placed, abandoned), idle seconds by now()
        DB-->>CE: session or none
        opt active session silent for 60 minutes or more
            CE->>DB: CAS the session to 'abandoned' — then as if there were none
        end
        alt active session
            Note over CE: Route to the handler for the current state:<br/>browsing, fulfillment_choice or cart_review.
        else no active session
            CE->>CE: opening hours in the restaurant's timezone
            alt closed
                CE->>WA: closing message with today's opening hours · no session
            else open
                CE->>CE: build welcome + numbered menu · at most 4,096 characters
                CE->>DB: upsert customer · INSERT session 'new' ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING<br/>(one active session per customer)
                CE->>DB: CAS 'new' to 'browsing'
                CE->>WA: welcome + menu
            end
        end
        CE->>DB: COMMIT
        WA->>C: delivered
    end
